Z||000025||pontiacs4me||05-15-2001||12:20 PM||||Thanks Lisa, I used a dry pearl, added into the clear for those flames.  I painted the base, let it dry, laid out the flames, then sprayed 1 coat of pearl clear, pulled the tape, then layed 4 more coats of clear.  Then after it all dryed I sanded and buffed the line out.  Heres another pic of the flame job, its kind of hard to see, but theyre there.  <A HREF="http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/birdsflames2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/birdsflames2.jpg</A>  let me know if youll be in ks anytime this summer and I can do them for ya.||||reg||1
